2. In this Order —
“Agency” means the Singapore Food Agency established by section 3 of the Singapore Food Agency Act 2019;
“animal feed” has the meaning given by section 2 of the Feeding Stuffs Act 1965;
“food” has the meaning given by section 2A of the Sale of Food Act 1973;
“foreign country” means a country or territory outside Singapore;
“handling”, in relation to food, has the meaning given by section 2 of the Sale of Food Act 1973.
